{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/extras/story.png?t=1746554185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fairy-tale republic of Novgorod, XIII century. Ivan the Bard dreams of becoming famous, rich and marrying the prince's daughter, but he has no luck: Ivan is not invited to play at feasts, and even simple girls do not want to date him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day fate gives the young man a chance. Ivan meets a magical assistant who promises to fulfil his daring dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/extras/prologue_features.png?t=1746554185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is an author's fairy tale for adults, inspired by Russian history and bylinas. Start a romantic adventure in realities referring to the medieval Novgorod Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits you in prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About an hour of reading. Narrative stylised in Old Russian vernacular. Minimum of detached reasoning, maximum of dialogue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 characters from different layers of medieval society. Some of them will be meet in the main story as well</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 10 colourful backgrounds on which the locations of medieval Novgorod are recreated: streets, manor houses, trading, veche and others.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual style inspired by the illustrations of Ivan Bilibin.\u00a0Everything is hand drawn, no AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lore is rich with references to the real history and culture of Novgorod. Fill up your vocabulary of Old Russian words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven musical compositions written especially for the game. Professional sound engineering.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686300?t=1746554185","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/b5a16abf318cd7197baa91f3e47018e789139454/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746554185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/66b0577fbe7543447aa31f0b14a2ceb6d1ca1216/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746554185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/66b0577fbe7543447aa31f0b14a2ceb6d1ca1216/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746554185","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/extras/story.png?t=1746554185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fairy-tale republic of Novgorod, XIII century. Ivan the Bard dreams of becoming famous, rich and marrying the prince's daughter, but he has no luck: Ivan is not invited to play at feasts, and even simple girls do not want to date him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day fate gives the young man a chance. Ivan meets a magical assistant who promises to fulfil his daring dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/extras/prologue_features.png?t=1746554185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is an author's fairy tale for adults, inspired by Russian history and bylinas. Start a romantic adventure in realities referring to the medieval Novgorod Republic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What awaits you in prologue:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About an hour of reading. Narrative stylised in Old Russian vernacular. Minimum of detached reasoning, maximum of dialogue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 characters from different layers of medieval society. Some of them will be meet in the main story as well</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 10 colourful backgrounds on which the locations of medieval Novgorod are recreated: streets, manor houses, trading, veche and others.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual style inspired by the illustrations of Ivan Bilibin.\u00a0Everything is hand drawn, no AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lore is rich with references to the real history and culture of Novgorod. Fill up your vocabulary of Old Russian words!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seven musical compositions written especially for the game. Professional sound engineering.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CopperSnake Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3681690","name":"The Wondrous Wedding of Ivan the Bard"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686300/17577966a55a5cacb8183333ca502be0e941e215/header.jpg?t=1746554185","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257135360,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135360/movie480.mp4?t=1746554183","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257135360/movie_max.mp4?t=1746554183"},"name":"\u0412\u043e\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0431\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0441\u0432\u0430\u0434\u044c\u0431\u0430 \u0433\u0443\u0441\u043b\u044f\u0440\u0430 \u0418\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0430","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257135360/c39a0ed4252a8bf932a438d286b3e446c86c5796/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746554183","webm":{"480":"htt